<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Iqbal Miftahul Rahman — Driver Management, Blitz Electric Mobility</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#12142a;
    --panel:#1a1d3c;
    --panel-2:#212650;
    --gold:#d9ac53;
    --gold-dim:rgba(217,172,83,0.35);
    --teal:#3fbfab;
    --coral:#e2735a;
    --text:#f2efe9;
    --text-dim:#9a9ec4;
    --line:rgba(217,172,83,0.16);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 500px at 15% -10%, rgba(217,172,83,0.10), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 700px 500px at 100% 10%, rgba(63,191,171,0.08), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px;}
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;}

  /* NAV */
  nav{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(18,20,42,0.82);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav .wrap{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; height:64px;}
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.02em;}
  .brand .dot{width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--teal); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(63,191,171,0.18); animation:pulse 2.4s infinite;}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:0.35;}}
  .nav-right{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:28px;}
  nav ul{list-style:none; display:flex; gap:28px;}
  nav a{color:var(--text-dim); text-decoration:none; font-size:13.5px; letter-spacing:0.04em; text-transform:uppercase; transition:color 0.2s;}
  nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--gold);}
  .btn-cv-mini{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.03em; color:#14172b; background:var(--gold); padding:8px 14px; border-radius:3px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; transition:transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s; white-space:nowrap;}
  .btn-cv-mini:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(217,172,83,0.22);}
  @media (max-width:640px){ nav ul{display:none;} }

  /* HERO */
  header.hero{padding:100px 0 80px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:0.14em;
    color:var(--gold); text-transform:uppercase; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:''; width:26px; height:1px; background:var(--gold);}
  h1{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 5.2vw, 4rem); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    max-width:820px;
  }
  h1 span{color:var(--gold);}
  .role-line{margin-top:18px; font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--text-dim); max-width:620px;}
  .hero-actions{margin-top:36px; display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    padding:13px 22px; border-radius:3px; text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    transition:transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--gold); color:#14172b; font-weight:600;}
  .btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(217,172,83,0.25);}
  .btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--text);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold-dim);}

  /* STAT STRIP */
  .stats{margin-top:64px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;}
  .stat{padding:22px 20px; border-right:1px solid var(--line);}
  .stat:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .stat .num{font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size:1.9rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--gold);}
  .stat .label{font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em; margin-top:4px;}

  /* SECTION GENERIC */
  section{padding:80px 0;}
  section.alt{background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(33,38,80,0.35) 8%, rgba(33,38,80,0.35) 92%, transparent);}
  .section-head{margin-bottom:44px;}
  h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size:1.9rem; font-weight:600;}
  .section-sub{color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:10px; max-width:560px;}

  /* ABOUT */
  .about-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr; gap:48px; align-items:start;}
  .about-grid p{color:var(--text-dim); margin-bottom:16px;}
  .about-grid p strong{color:var(--text); font-weight:500;}
  .facts{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;}
  .fact{padding:16px 18px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; font-size:13.5px;}
  .fact:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .fact .k{color:var(--text-dim); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:11.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;}
  .fact .v{text-align:right;}

  /* MANIFEST / PROJECTS */
  .manifest{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;}
  .card{
    background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:7px; padding:26px 28px;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:26px; align-items:start;
    transition:border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .card:hover{border-color:var(--gold-dim); transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .card-route{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .card-route .hub{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.05em; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase;}
  .route-line{position:relative; height:1px; background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-dim) 0 6px, transparent 6px 12px); margin:2px 0;}
  .route-line::before, .route-line::after{content:''; position:absolute; top:50%; width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);}
  .route-line::before{left:-3px; background:var(--teal);}
  .route-line::after{right:-3px; background:var(--gold);}
  .status{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:20px; width:fit-content;}
  .status .sdot{width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%;}
  .status.active{background:rgba(63,191,171,0.12); color:var(--teal);}
  .status.active .sdot{background:var(--teal);}
  .status.done{background:rgba(217,172,83,0.12); color:var(--gold);}
  .status.done .sdot{background:var(--gold);}
  .status.ongoing{background:rgba(226,115,90,0.12); color:var(--coral);}
  .status.ongoing .sdot{background:var(--coral);}
  .card-body h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .card-body p{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:14.5px; margin-bottom:12px;}
  .card-body ul{list-style:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .card-body li{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-dim); padding-left:14px; position:relative;}
  .card-body li::before{content:'—'; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--gold);}
  .tags{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .tag{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:4px 9px; border-radius:20px;}

  .artifact-preview{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-top:16px;}
  .mock{width:76px; height:54px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel-2); flex-shrink:0; padding:7px; position:relative;}
  .mock-slide-bar{height:6px; width:60%; background:var(--gold); border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .mock-slide-line{height:3px; background:rgba(242,239,233,0.18); border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .mock-slide-line.w1{width:88%;}
  .mock-slide-line.w2{width:60%;}
  .mock-slide-chart{display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:3px; height:14px; margin-top:5px;}
  .mock-slide-chart span{width:6px; background:var(--teal); border-radius:1px; display:block;}
  .mock-slide-chart span:nth-child(1){height:40%;}
  .mock-slide-chart span:nth-child(2){height:75%;}
  .mock-slide-chart span:nth-child(3){height:55%;}
  .mock-slide-chart span:nth-child(4){height:95%;}
  .mock-sheet-header{height:9px; background:var(--gold-dim); border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:5px;}
  .mock-sheet-row{height:6px; background:rgba(242,239,233,0.12); border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .mock-sheet-row.highlight{background:rgba(63,191,171,0.35);}
  .preview-caption{font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; max-width:160px; line-height:1.45;}

  @media (max-width:720px){
    .card{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .stat:nth-child(2){border-right:none;}
    .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }

  /* FRAUD */
  .alert-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:18px;}
  .alert-card{background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-left:3px solid var(--coral); border-radius:6px; padding:22px;}
  .alert-card .tag-code{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--coral); letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:10px; display:block;}
  .alert-card h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .alert-card p{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13.5px;}
  .fraud-note{margin-top:22px; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13.5px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:18px;}
  @media (max-width:720px){.alert-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  /* SKILLS */
  .skill-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:14px;}
  .skill{background:var(--panel-2); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; padding:18px 20px;}
  .skill .label{font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:14.5px; margin-bottom:5px;}
  .skill .desc{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  @media (max-width:720px){.skill-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  @media (max-width:480px){.skill-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:56px 0 40px;}
  .footer-grid{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px;}
  footer h2{font-size:1.6rem;}
  footer .section-sub{margin-bottom:22px;}
  .foot-meta{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; align-items:flex-end; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  .foot-meta a{color:var(--gold); text-decoration:none;}
  @media (max-width:720px){.foot-meta{align-items:flex-start;}}

  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(16px); transition:opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{opacity:1; transform:none; transition:none;}
    .brand .dot{animation:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand"><span class="dot"></span> IQBAL M. RAHMAN</div>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#tentang">Tentang</a></li>
        <li><a href="#proyek">Proyek</a></li>
        <li><a href="#keahlian">Keahlian</a></li>
        <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn-cv-mini" href="Iqbal_Miftahul_Rahman_Resume.pdf" download>Unduh CV ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Driver Management — Blitz Electric Mobility</div>
    <h1>Mengelola operasional rider lintas hub, dari data sampai jalan.<span>.</span></h1>
    <p class="role-line">Iqbal Miftahul Rahman — menangani akuisisi &amp; onboarding rider, pencegahan fraud, canvassing lapangan, dan pelaporan operasional untuk klien-klien besar di bawah Blitz Electric Mobility.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#proyek">Lihat Manifest Proyek ↓</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="Iqbal_Miftahul_Rahman_Resume.pdf" download>Unduh CV (PDF) ↓</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://linkedin.com/in/iqbal-miftahul-22ba97141" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hubungi via LinkedIn</a>
    </div>

    <div class="stats reveal">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">3</div><div class="label">Hub Wilayah Operasi</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">6</div><div class="label">Proyek Klien</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">3</div><div class="label">Bahasa — ID / EN / AR</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">10+</div><div class="label">Hub Diaudit (Allofresh)</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="tentang">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <h2>Tentang</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Latar belakang operasional yang menghubungkan lapangan, data, dan tim.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>Berbasis di <strong>Bekasi Timur</strong>, saat ini mengelola operasional rider TikTok Shop (TTS) lintas wilayah <strong>Jabodetabek</strong> di Blitz Electric Mobility — mencakup akuisisi rider, onboarding, pencegahan fraud, canvassing lapangan, hingga koordinasi lintas tim Back Office dan Field.</p>
        <p>Sebelum di Driver Management, berperan sebagai <strong>Implant Leader</strong> di Blitz Expedition (gudang &amp; logistik), dan sebagai <strong>Travel Agent</strong> di PT Farhan Surya Indah menggunakan sistem GDS Amadeus dan Sabre.</p>
        <p>Saat ini menempuh pendidikan <strong>Digital Business</strong> di Universitas Insan Cita Indonesia, sambil terus membangun kemampuan otomasi data (Python/openpyxl) dan pelaporan visual untuk kebutuhan operasional.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="facts reveal">
        <div class="fact"><span class="k">Lokasi</span><span class="v">Bekasi Timur, Indonesia</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="k">Peran saat ini</span><span class="v">Driver Management / Ops</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="k">Bahasa</span><span class="v">Indonesia, Inggris, Arab</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="k">Pendidikan</span><span class="v">Digital Business, UICI</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="k">Wilayah kerja</span><span class="v">Jabodetabek</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt" id="proyek">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <h2>Manifest Proyek</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Enam proyek klien yang ditangani di bawah Blitz Electric Mobility, dari akuisisi rider sampai pelaporan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="manifest">

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-route">
          <span class="hub">Jabodetabek</span>
          <div class="route-line"></div>
          <span class="status active"><span class="sdot"></span>Aktif</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>TikTok Shop (TTS)</h3>
          <p>Mengelola operasional rider TikTok Shop di tiga hub sekaligus — dari data harian sampai laporan ke manajemen.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Deck 4 isu kekurangan rider Bekasi Raya: tarif flat, tier AWB, rotasi area, volume paket besar</li>
            <li>Workbook Excel via Python/openpyxl — header navy, freeze pane, ringkasan COUNTIF</li>
            <li>Pelaporan bug aplikasi driver ke tim tech internal</li>
            <li>Tabel HTML interaktif untuk monitoring rider tanpa orderan</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Excel/openpyxl</span><span class="tag">PPTX</span><span class="tag">Reporting</span></div>
          <div class="artifact-preview">
            <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="mock-slide-bar"></div>
              <div class="mock-slide-line w1"></div>
              <div class="mock-slide-line w2"></div>
              <div class="mock-slide-chart"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="preview-caption">Contoh tampilan deck rider shortage (data digeneralisasi)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-route">
          <span class="hub">10 Hub — Bintaro, Cawang, dll.</span>
          <div class="route-line"></div>
          <span class="status done"><span class="sdot"></span>Selesai</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Allofresh</h3>
          <p>Audit kekurangan rider di sepuluh hub, menemukan indikasi rider internal Blitz ikut tertarik ke operasional Allofresh.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Investigasi lintas 10 hub: Bintaro, Cawang, Cipondoh, Gading Serpong, Lebak Bulus, Tanjung Duren, Depok, Ciracas, Galaxy Bekasi, Cempaka Putih</li>
            <li>Mengusulkan skema pembayaran H+1 untuk retensi rider</li>
            <li>Beberapa iterasi deck presentasi untuk manajemen</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Audit</span><span class="tag">PPTX</span><span class="tag">Retensi Rider</span></div>
          <div class="artifact-preview">
            <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="mock-slide-bar"></div>
              <div class="mock-slide-line w1"></div>
              <div class="mock-slide-line w2"></div>
              <div class="mock-slide-chart"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="preview-caption">Contoh tampilan deck audit hub (data digeneralisasi)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-route">
          <span class="hub">Distribusi Farmasi</span>
          <div class="route-line"></div>
          <span class="status done"><span class="sdot"></span>Selesai</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>SwipeRx</h3>
          <p>Dokumentasi keterlibatan kerja untuk klien distribusi farmasi, mencakup audit invoice dan otomasi data.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Laporan Keterlibatan Kerja (2–10 Mei)</li>
            <li>Audit data invoice &amp; automasi Python untuk pemrosesan Excel</li>
            <li>Analisis pivot faktur pending per hub dan bulan</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Python Automation</span><span class="tag">Invoice Audit</span><span class="tag">Laporan</span></div>
          <div class="artifact-preview">
            <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="mock-sheet-header"></div>
              <div class="mock-sheet-row"></div>
              <div class="mock-sheet-row highlight"></div>
              <div class="mock-sheet-row"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="preview-caption">Contoh tampilan workbook pivot faktur (data digeneralisasi)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-route">
          <span class="hub">Klien E-commerce</span>
          <div class="route-line"></div>
          <span class="status ongoing"><span class="sdot"></span>Berjalan</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Blibli</h3>
          <p>Koordinasi operasional rider untuk mitra pengiriman e-commerce Blibli.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Menjaga ketersediaan rider harian sesuai kebutuhan pengiriman mitra</li>
            <li>Eskalasi kendala operasional ke tim terkait untuk penyelesaian cepat</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Operasional Rider</span><span class="tag">Koordinasi Mitra</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-route">
          <span class="hub">Klien E-commerce Fashion</span>
          <div class="route-line"></div>
          <span class="status ongoing"><span class="sdot"></span>Berjalan</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Zalora</h3>
          <p>Koordinasi operasional rider untuk mitra pengiriman fashion e-commerce Zalora.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Pengaturan alokasi rider untuk kebutuhan pengiriman produk fashion</li>
            <li>Koordinasi dengan Back Office untuk update status onboarding &amp; ketersediaan rider</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Operasional Rider</span><span class="tag">Alokasi Rider</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-route">
          <span class="hub">Klien Logistik</span>
          <div class="route-line"></div>
          <span class="status ongoing"><span class="sdot"></span>Berjalan</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3>Merapi</h3>
          <p>Dukungan operasional rider untuk klien logistik Merapi.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Menjaga kelancaran distribusi harian untuk klien logistik Merapi</li>
            <li>Koordinasi lintas tim Field &amp; Back Office untuk penyelesaian kendala operasional</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Operasional Rider</span><span class="tag">Distribusi Logistik</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="fraud">
